  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Fotogrammetrie</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> March 2022 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>V průběhu několika let jsem pomocí fotogrammetrie skenoval různé struktury. Projekt funguje jako prostorová koláž míst a bytostí napříč časem.</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-9.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"zleva: Filip Drábek, Ondřej Kučera, František Dalibaba, Vojta Maur\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-1.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"zleva: Vojta Maur, Filip Drábek, Michaela Stehlíková\"> </a>  </figure>\n<span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-2.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur leží v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém ...\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-4.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur leží v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém ...\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-3.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v bytě\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-5.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur izolovaný v pokoji\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-6.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v pokoji, širokoúhlý záběr\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-8.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"low poly Vojta Maur v pokoji\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-11.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v koupelně\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-7.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v ložnici\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-10.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v obývacím pokoji\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-12.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v kuchyni\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-13.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v kuchyni\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-14.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v kuchyni\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-15.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"zahrada\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-16.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur na zahradě, ortografická perspektiva\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-20.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-20.jpg\" alt=\"Helena Horáková v umyvadle\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-18.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-18.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur armáda\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-17.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-17.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur šroubovice\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-19.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-19.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur obrazec\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Photogrammetry</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> March 2022 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>Over the course of several years, I have used photogrammetry to scan various structures. The project functions as a spatial collage of places and beings across time.</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-9.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"zleva: Filip Drábek, Ondřej Kučera, František Dalibaba, Vojta Maur\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-1.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"zleva: Vojta Maur, Filip Drábek, Michaela Stehlíková\"> </a>  </figure>\n<span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-2.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur leží v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém ...\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-4.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur leží v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém leží Vojta Maur v bytě vedle bytu, ve kterém ...\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-3.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v bytě\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-5.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur izolovaný v pokoji\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-6.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v pokoji, širokoúhlý záběr\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-8.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"low poly Vojta Maur v pokoji\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-11.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v koupelně\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-7.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v ložnici\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-10.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v obývacím pokoji\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-12.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v kuchyni\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-13.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v kuchyni\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-14.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur v kuchyni\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-15.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"zahrada\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-16.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur na zahradě, ortografická perspektiva\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-20.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-20.jpg\" alt=\"Helena Horáková v umyvadle\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-18.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-18.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur armáda\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-17.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-17.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur šroubovice\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-19.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-19.jpg\" alt=\"Vojta Maur obrazec\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
